    "sections": {
        "description": "<p><strong>Turn plain text into eye-catching info cards that make your content easier to scan, understand, and remember – no code required.</strong></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/info-cards\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Info Cards</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/info-cards/#demos\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Demos</a></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/info-cards/pricing/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Pricing</a></strong></p>\n<h3>Why Info Cards?</h3>\n<p>Walls of text lose readers. <strong>Info Cards</strong> is a Gutenberg block that lets you present content as beautifully designed, informative cards – combining images, text, and links in layouts your audience can consume at a glance.</p>\n<p>Choose from built-in templates or create your own custom layout to fit your branding. Set columns, gaps, colors, and typography from the block sidebar – no code or additional software needed, even if you have limited technical knowledge.</p>\n<p>Every card layout is fully responsive, so your content looks great and functions perfectly across all devices and screen sizes. Whether you&#8217;re creating product cards, team member profiles, or informational sections, Info Cards helps your content stand out.</p>\n<h3>Free Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Fully Customizable:</strong> Adjust every part of the card to match your site.</li>\n<li><strong>Custom Colors:</strong> Use your brand&#8217;s colors throughout.</li>\n<li><strong>Built-in Templates:</strong> Start from ready-made card designs.</li>\n<li><strong>Layout Control:</strong> Set columns, column gap, and row gap.</li>\n<li><strong>Image Support:</strong> Use an image in each card.</li>\n<li><strong>Link Support:</strong> Make cards clickable with links.</li>\n<li><strong>Typography:</strong> Control the text styling of your cards.</li>\n<li><strong>Responsive Layout:</strong> Cards adapt to all devices and screen sizes.</li>\n<li><strong>Easy to Use:</strong> Add and customize cards straight from the block editor.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Pro Version</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/info-cards/pricing/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\"><strong>Info Cards Pro</strong></a> unlocks more designs and deeper styling control:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Universal Shortcodes:</strong> Compatible with all page builders.</li>\n<li><strong>12+ Ready-Made Themes:</strong> Professionally designed card styles.</li>\n<li><strong>Advanced Templates &amp; Layouts:</strong> More ways to arrange your cards.</li>\n<li><strong>More Typography Controls:</strong> Font family, weight, and spacing.</li>\n<li><strong>Hover &amp; Animation Effects:</strong> Bring cards to life on interaction.</li>\n<li><strong>Gradient &amp; Advanced Color Options:</strong> Richer backgrounds and accents.</li>\n<li><strong>Full Box Control:</strong> Border, padding, and margin settings.</li>\n<li><strong>Card Shadows &amp; Depth Effects:</strong> Add dimension to your layouts.</li>\n<li><strong>7+ New Built-in Blocks:</strong> Extra card blocks to build with.</li>\n<li><strong>Priority Updates &amp; Support.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>How to Use</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Install and activate the <strong>Info Cards</strong> plugin.</li>\n<li>Go to the page or post where you want to embed the cards.</li>\n<li>Click the <strong>+</strong> button in the Gutenberg editor and search for <strong>Info Cards</strong>.</li>\n<li>Select the <strong>Info Cards</strong> block.</li>\n<li>Create and customize your cards, then publish. Enjoy!</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>Use Cases</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Product Highlights:</strong> Present features or products in scannable cards.</li>\n<li><strong>Team Profiles:</strong> Introduce team members with photo, name, and link.</li>\n<li><strong>Service Sections:</strong> Summarize what you offer in a clean grid.</li>\n<li><strong>Informational Content:</strong> Break long content into digestible cards.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Feedback</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Liked that plugin? Hate it? Want a new feature? <a href=\"mailto:support@bplugins.com\" title=\"Send feedback\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Send me some feedback</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4>⭐ Check out the Parent Plugin of this plugin-</h4>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bblockswp.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">bBlocks</a></strong> – Best gutenberg blocks collections for WordPress.</p>\n<h4>⭐ Check out our other WordPress Plugins-</h4>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/html5-audio-player\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Html5 Audio Player</a></strong> – Best audio player plugin for WordPress.</p>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/html5-video-player\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Html5 Video Player</a></strong> – Best video player plugin for WordPress.</p>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/pdf-poster\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">PDF Poster</a></strong> – A fully-featured PDF Viewer Plugin for WordPress.</p>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/streamcast-radio-player\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">StreamCast</a></strong> – A fully-featured Radio Player Plugin for WordPress.</p>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/3d-viewer\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">3D Viewer</a></strong> – Display interactive 3D models on the webs.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<p><strong>From your WordPress dashboard (recommended):</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Go to <strong>Plugins <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Add New</strong>.</li>\n<li>Search for <strong>&#8220;Info Cards&#8221;</strong>.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Install Now</strong>, then <strong>Activate</strong>.</li>\n<li>Add the <strong>Info Cards</strong> block to any post or page in the Gutenberg editor.</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Manual installation:</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Download the plugin zip file from WordPress.org.</li>\n<li>Upload the plugin to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory, or upload the zip via <strong>Plugins <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Add New <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Upload Plugin</strong>.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the <strong>Plugins</strong> menu in WordPress.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"what%20does%20%22block%20plugin%22%20mean%3F\">\nWhat does &#8220;block plugin&#8221; mean?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>A block plugin adds additional Gutenberg blocks to the WordPress block editor.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"can%20i%20use%20my%20brand%27s%20colors%3F\">\nCan I use my brand&#8217;s colors?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, the cards are fully customizable, including custom colors and typography.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"are%20there%20ready-made%20designs%20i%20can%20start%20from%3F\">\nAre there ready-made designs I can start from?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. The free version includes built-in templates, and the Pro version adds 12+ ready-made themes plus advanced templates and layouts.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"do%20the%20cards%20work%20on%20mobile%20devices%3F\">\nDo the cards work on mobile devices?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. The layout is fully responsive, and you can control columns and gaps so cards look great on all screen sizes.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"can%20i%20use%20info%20cards%20with%20page%20builders%20other%20than%20gutenberg%3F\">\nCan I use Info Cards with page builders other than Gutenberg?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>The free version is a Gutenberg block. The Pro version adds universal shortcodes that are compatible with all page builders.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"does%20it%20work%20with%20any%20wordpress%20theme%3F\">\nDoes it work with any WordPress theme?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, it will work with any standard WordPress theme.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"can%20i%20change%20block%20settings%3F\">\nCan I change block settings?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, you can change block settings from the Gutenberg block editor&#8217;s right sidebar.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"how%20many%20times%20can%20i%20reuse%20the%20block%3F\">\nHow many times can I reuse the block?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>You can use the block an unlimited number of times.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"do%20you%20offer%20plugin%20customization%20services%3F\">\nDo you offer plugin customization services?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. If you need any service from us, please contact <a href=\"https://bplugins.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">bPlugins support</a>.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"where%20can%20i%20get%20support%3F\">\nWhere can I get support?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>You can post your questions on the <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/support/plugin/info-cards/\" rel=\"ugc\">support forum here</a></p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>3.0.2- 08 July, 2026</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add the Modern Dashboard</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>3.0.1- 10 June, 2026</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added a modern and intuitive dashboard layout.</li>\n<li>Fixed CDN loading issue on page load</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>3.0.0- 18 May, 2026</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added 8+ new built-in blocks.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.0.4- 29 Aug, 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added a help page to this plugin.;</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.0.2- 18 Aug, 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>added new prefix;</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.0.1- 17 Aug, 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fatal error resolved;</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.0.0 &#8211; 14 Aug, 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Resolved the button hide issue and added five new themes;</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.10 &#8211; 18 June, 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Resolved breakpoint issues for desktop, tablet, and mobile devices;</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.9 &#8211; 15 June, 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>The &#8220;Undefined array key &#8216;HTTP_HOST'&#8221; issue has been resolved;</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.8 &#8211; 27 May, 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Card text decoration problem fixed.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.7 &#8211; 25 April, 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Compatible with WordPress 6.8;</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.6 &#8211; 15 Feb, 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>I have fixed the vulnerability related to Cross-Site Scripting (XSS).</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.5 &#8211; 15 Nov 2024</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed background issue in default theme</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.4 &#8211; 13 Nov 2024</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>New feature added.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.3 &#8211; 20 Oct 2024</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix the issue.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>16 Jan 2024 &#8211; 1.0.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed: Plugin Name</li>\n<li>Fixed: Layout change</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add a New Theme</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial Release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
